<h1>Campus Connect UNIZIK - Privacy Policy, Terms & Ad Policy</h1>
<p><b>Last Updated: May 13, 2026 | App: campus-connect-unizik | Developer: Campus Connect Team, Nnamdi Azikiwe University</b></p>

<h2>1. Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>We respect your privacy. Campus Connect is a student community app for UNIZIK.</p>
<p><b>Data We Collect:</b><br>
- Email, Display Name, Profile Photo (via Firebase Auth)<br>
- Posts: Text, Images (Base64), Videos (Base64) you upload<br>
- Marketplace items: Price, Location<br>
- Chat messages (encrypted in transit via HTTPS)<br>
- Device: IP, device type for security<br>
- No location tracking in background.</p>
<p><b>How We Use:</b> To show your posts to other students, secure login, prevent spam, marketplace. We NEVER sell your data.</p>
<p><b>Storage:</b> All data stored securely in Google Firebase Firestore (Google Cloud) - encrypted at rest and in transit. Images/videos stored as secure Base64 in Firestore, not third-party bucket.</p>
<p><b>Your Rights (NDPA Nigeria + GDPR):</b> You can delete your account and all posts anytime: Profile > Log Out > Contact us at campusconnect.unizik@gmail.com to delete data within 48 hours.</p>

<h2>2. Ad Privacy & Protection Policy (For AdMob / Google Ads)</h2>
<p>We may show ads to keep app free.</p>
<p><b>Ad Partners:</b> Google AdMob, Google AdSense may collect Advertising ID, device info to show personalized ads. You can opt-out:</p>
<p>Android: Settings > Privacy > Ads > Delete Advertising ID<br>iOS: Settings > Privacy > Tracking > Off</p>
<p><b>We DO NOT:</b><br>
- Show ads to users under 18 for gambling, alcohol, adult content<br>
- Click our own ads<br>
- Place ads near post buttons (no accidental clicks)<br>
- Collect sensitive data for ads</p>
<p><b>Ad Safety:</b> All ads reviewed by Google. If you see bad ad, report to campusconnect.unizik@gmail.com</p>

<h2>3. Terms and Conditions</h2>
<p><b>By using Campus Connect, you agree:</b></p>
<p>1. You are UNIZIK student or alumni, 16+ years.<br>
2. No posting: nudity, drugs, scam, hate speech, exam leak, impersonation.<br>
3. Marketplace: Sell only legal items. Verify hostel before payment. We are not liable for transactions.<br>
4. You own your content, but give us license to show it in app.<br>
5. We can remove posts that violate rules.<br>
6. No spam, no fake accounts.<br>
7. Account ban after 3 violations.</p>

<h2>4. Security & Encryption</h2>
<p>- All traffic HTTPS/TLS 1.3<br>
- Firebase Auth: Passwords hashed by Google, we never see it<br>
- Firestore Rules: Only authenticated users can post (allow read, write: if request.auth != null)<br>
- Base64 media encrypted at rest<br>
- Chat: Encrypted in transit (HTTPS), stored encrypted<br>
- No public storage bucket - secure by design like Telegram/Snapchat</p>

<h2>5. System Backup & Data Protection</h2>
<p><b>Backup:</b> Daily automated backup via Firebase (Google Cloud) in us-central1. 30-day retention. Point-in-time recovery.<br>
<b>Disaster Recovery:</b> If data lost, restore from Firebase backup within 24h.<br>
<b>User Backup:</b> Your posts are backed up in cloud. If you delete app, data remains until you request deletion.<br>
<b>Server: Cloudflare Pages + Firebase = 99.9% uptime</b></p>

<h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>App not for children under 16. If you are under 16, do not use.</p>

<h2>7. Contact & Deletion</h2>
<p>Email: campusconnect.unizik@gmail.com<br>
University: Nnamdi Azikiwe University, Awka<br>
To delete data: Email us with subject "DELETE MY DATA" - we delete in 48h.</p>

<p style="margin-top:30px;background:#ffcc00;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:800">This policy complies with Google Play, AdMob, Nigeria NDPA 2023, GDPR.</p>
</body></html>